  <diagram id="l0WzR_wT92C-8aFFjKIL" name="系统总体架构">
    <mxGraphModel dx="901" dy="588" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n!define RECTANGLE class\n\n&#39; 设置背景透明，方便嵌入文档\nskinparam backgroundColor transparent\nskinparam componentStyle rectangle\n\n&#39; 各层配色区分\nskinparam component {\n  BackgroundColor&lt;&lt;frontend&gt;&gt; #E1F5FE\n  BorderColor&lt;&lt;frontend&gt;&gt; #01579B\n  BackgroundColor&lt;&lt;backend&gt;&gt; #E8F5E9\n  BorderColor&lt;&lt;backend&gt;&gt; #1B5E20\n  BackgroundColor&lt;&lt;database&gt;&gt; #FFF3E0\n  BorderColor&lt;&lt;database&gt;&gt; #E65100\n}\n\ntitle 系统架构图 (B/S 前后端分离)\n\n&#39; 第一层：浏览器端\npackage \&quot;浏览器端 (Browser)\&quot; {\n    component \&quot;Vue 单页应用 (SPA)\&quot; as Vue &lt;&lt;frontend&gt;&gt;\n}\n\n&#39; 第二层：后端服务\npackage \&quot;Spring Boot 后端\&quot; {\n    component \&quot;REST API\&quot; as Rest &lt;&lt;backend&gt;&gt;\n    component \&quot;WebSocket 服务\&quot; as Ws &lt;&lt;backend&gt;&gt;\n    component \&quot;Spring Data JPA\&quot; as Jpa &lt;&lt;backend&gt;&gt;\n    component \&quot;Spring Data Redis\&quot; as Sdr &lt;&lt;backend&gt;&gt;\n}\n\n&#39; 第三层：数据存储\npackage \&quot;数据层\&quot; {\n    database \&quot;MySQL (主数据存储)\&quot; as MySQL &lt;&lt;database&gt;&gt;\n    database \&quot;Redis (缓存与实时数据暂存)\&quot; as Redis &lt;&lt;database&gt;&gt;\n}\n\n&#39; 协议与调用关系\nVue -down-&gt; Rest : HTTP / HTTPS\nVue -down-&gt; Ws : WebSocket\nRest -down-&gt; Jpa : 数据操作\nRest -down-&gt; Sdr : 缓存操作\nWs -down-&gt; Sdr : 实时数据暂存\nJpa -down-&gt; MySQL : JDBC / JPA\nSdr -down-&gt; Redis : 缓存读写\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="l0X0u44i8C4O2T_OyTO7-127">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="573" width="428" x="200" y="30" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
